<title>FRANCE: AGF says not interested in GAN.</title>
<headline>AGF says not interested in GAN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer AGF denied on Thursday rumours which it said were circulating in the market that it was interested in buying state-controlled insurer GAN.</p>
<p>An AGF spokesman said he &quot;categorically denied the rumours,&quot; adding that no talks were under way with GAN or its state owners.</p>
<p>At 1244 GMT AGF shares were off 0.70 percent at 136.9 francs while GAN was off 0.27 percent at 111.70 francs against an overall firmer market.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
